---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import { SITE, ANALYTICS } from '../site.config';
const mail = SITE.publisher.email;
---
<Page title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} handles data, cookies and advertising, including Google AdSense, and the choices you have.`} path="/privacy/" updated="8 November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what information is collected when you visit <a href="/">{SITE.url.replace('https://', '')}</a> (“the site”), who collects it, and the choices you have. The site is operated by {SITE.publisher.name}, {SITE.publisher.location} (“we”, “us”).</p>

  <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
  <p>We do not ask you to create an account, and the site has no sign-up or comment forms. We do not collect your name or email address unless you choose to email us.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Emails you send us.</strong> If you contact us, we receive your email address and message and use them only to reply and to handle your request (for example, a correction).</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider automatically records technical information such as IP address, browser type, the page requested and the time of the request, for security and to keep the site running. These logs are kept for a limited period.</li>
    <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies</strong> set by the third-party services described below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Advertising (Google AdSense)</h2>
  <p>We use Google AdSense to show advertising. Google and its partners are third-party vendors that use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Google’s use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visits to this site and/or other sites on the Internet.</li>
    <li>You can opt out of personalised advertising by visiting <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Google Ads Settings</a>. You can also opt out of some third-party vendors’ use of cookies for personalised advertising at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>.</li>
    <li>Learn more about <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>.</li>
    <li>Visitors in the European Economic Area, the UK and Switzerland are shown a consent message, provided through Google’s consent management tools, before personalised ads or advertising cookies are used.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Analytics</h2>
  {ANALYTICS.clarity && <p>We use <strong>Microsoft Clarity</strong> to understand how readers use the site (for example, which pages are read and where people stop scrolling) so we can improve it. Clarity uses cookies and collects usage data such as clicks, scrolling and device information. See the <a href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/privacystatement" rel="nofollow noopener">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</p>}
  {ANALYTICS.ga4 && <p>We use <strong>Google Analytics</strong> to measure traffic. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="nofollow noopener">Google’s Privacy Policy</a>.</p>}
  <p>We use analytics data in aggregate. We do not sell personal information.</p>

  <h2>4. Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings. Blocking cookies does not stop you reading the site, but ads may be less relevant.</p>

  <h2>5. Legal basis and your rights</h2>
  <p>Where data-protection law such as India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023, or the EU/UK GDPR applies, we rely on your consent for advertising and analytics cookies where required, and on our legitimate interest in operating and securing the site for server logs. Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal data we hold about you, to withdraw consent, and to complain to a data-protection authority. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${mail}?subject=Privacy%20request`}>{mail}</a>.</p>

  <h2>6. Children</h2>
  <p>The site is intended for a general adult audience and is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

  <h2>7. Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>Our articles link to many external sources. Those sites have their own privacy policies, which we do not control.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We will update this page if our practices change and revise the “last updated” date above.</p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy: <a href={`mailto:${mail}`}>{mail}</a>, {SITE.publisher.name}, {SITE.publisher.location}.</p>
</Page>
